/E (There are many rules about wind turbines in Alphen aan den Rijn. Some rules apply to the whole of the Netherlands. Wind turbines may not be higher than 240 meters. They must also be at a distance from buildings. In the Netherlands this distance is 480 meters, but in Alphen aan den Rijn it is 550-700 meters. Wind turbines are not allowed in protected natural areas.)
