/E (Alphen aan den Rijn and Istanbul possess different yet complementary strengths in renewable energy. Alphen has mastered the "democratization of energy" by involving the local community in energy cooperatives and successfully bringing production down to the neighborhood level. Conversely, Istanbul stands out with its high industrial speed, rapidly modernizing massive industrial basins and public infrastructure to integrate large amounts of clean energy into the grid.)
