96 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The Netherlands has worldwide the most solar panels per person. Each Dutch person has, on average, 3.5 solar panels installed. A total of 3 million households have solar panels. This means that 35% of the residents in the Netherlands have solar panels. In Alphen aan den Rijn 18% of the residents have them.  This means that Alphen aan den Rijn is lagging behind the Dutch average.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
97 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
