/P 45 0 R
/E (There is an organization called Zon op Alphen \(Sun on Alphen\). They have set up several projects to generate even more solar energy. They have placed 1,844 solar panels on the roof of a large company called Rijnvicus. With these panels they can provide enough energy for about 200 households. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
