129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (With this program we have a few achievable goals for the future, in 2050 we plan to not use any more natural gas because it is damaging for our climate. We also want 80% of the region to be fully dependent on renewable energy.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (Istanbul is accelerating its renewable energy investments in line with its goal of becoming a "Carbon Neutral" metropolis by 2050. As the most vital part of this strategy, the "Solar City Istanbul" vision aims to transform the rooftops of all public buildings, parking lots, and logistics centers into full-capacity solar power plants.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (To utilize the city's limited space efficiently, there are plans to expand "Floating SPP" systems installed on drinking water reservoirs. Additionally, the installation of massive battery storage systems in industrial zones aims to provide the solar energy generated during the day to industrial lines and the city grid uninterruptedly at night.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
