/P 48 0 R
/E (In terms of future implementation, Istanbul is set to deploy advanced solutions such as Floating SPP systems on water reservoirs, massive battery storage for night-time energy stability, and neighborhood-based smart microgrids. Meanwhile, Alphen aan den Rijn is focusing its efforts on the "Programma energietransitie," which prioritizes building isolation to save energy and the development of sustainable business parks. Their most significant goal is the complete transition away from natural gas by the year 2050 to protect the climate.)
